  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat a non-stick pan over medium heat.",
    "2. Add chopped broccoli to the pan and cook for 3-4 minutes.",
    "3. In a separate bowl, mix together mayonnaise, sour cream, garlic, salt, and pepper.",
    "4. Add the cooked broccoli to the bowl and mix well.",
    "5. Warm the gluten-free wrap in the microwave for 10-15 seconds.",
    "6. Spread the broccoli mixture on the wrap.",
    "7. Drizzle lemon juice on top of the broccoli mixture.",
    "8. Fold the wrap in half to serve."
